Mark a card waiting, with a note saying on what. Prefer 'lorvik ask --blocks'
when a human's answer is what you are waiting for. Waiting cards return to ready
by themselves when the questions blocking them are answered.

Example:
  lorvik wait 42 -m "needs staging credentials"

Usage
  lorvik wait <number> [flags]

Aliases
  wait, block

Flags
  -h, --help             help for wait
  -m, --message string   Short note recorded on the event

Global flags
      --api-url string   Server URL (default: LORVIK_API_URL)
      --json             Output the raw API JSON
  -p, --project string   Project slug (default: LORVIK_PROJECT or .lorvik.toml)
  -Q, --quiet            Suppress the unread notice on stderr and an empty inbox
      --session string   Session label for this chat (default: LORVIK_SESSION or derived; see lorvik session)
